<!-- JBrowse2 viewer shell (Phase B). Bundles are VENDORED under
     web/js/jbrowse2/ -- the CSP is script-src 'self', deliberately, so no CDN.
     LGV pinned to the mature 2.x line: 3.1.0 threw "invalid range in character
     class" from its config-expression system the first time feature rendering
     actually ran (2026-08-18). React 18 UMD satisfies both lines (2.x wants
     >=16.8); React 19 dropped UMD builds, so 18.x is the ceiling for this
     script-tag embedding style. Web workers come from blob: URLs, covered by
     the worker-src 'self' blob: CSP directive (added 2026-08-17). -->

<div id="jbrowse2_error" style="display:none;padding:1em;color:#a00;"></div>
<div id="jbrowse2_view" style="width:100%;"></div>

